Coefficients:
                 Estimate Std. Error t value Pr(>|t|)    
(Intercept)       2812.95     233.08  12.069  < 2e-16 ***
annual_mean_temp  -200.20      26.46  -7.567 8.51e-11 ***
---
Signif. codes:  0 '***' 0.001 '**' 0.01 '*' 0.05 '.' 0.1 ' ' 1

